"""
Strategy Engine Discord Cog for NeuraSelf.

Integrates the OwO Strategy Engine:
- Ingests active team and weapon inventory snapshots from OwO and NeonUtil responses.
- Implements !owo-eval / owo eval: evaluates active team EHP, DPS solvency, and win rate.
- Implements !owo-opt / owo opt: 3-stage multi-fidelity tournament optimizer with equip commands.
- Implements !owo-boss / owo boss: 24-turn Guild Boss raid simulation and composite score.
- Implements !owo-shards / owo shards: safe shard dismantle planner with strict dry_run = True guardrails.
"""

